{"pin":"AB03461","subcodes":[{"code":"AB03461","anchor":"","first_line":"O thou beloved maidservant of God! Thy letter ... was received and its contents became known. In this most Merciful Age the ignorant prejudices are entirely removed... Baha'í marriage is union and cordial affection between the two parties.","first_line_orig":"عقد بهائی ارتباط بين طرفين است و تعلّق خاطر بين جهتين ولی بايد نهايت دقّت بنمايند  ","language":"Per","word_count":"200","translations":[],"writing_refs":[{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"},{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"en","lang_name":"English"},{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}],"refs":[{"kind":"publication","code":"MMK1#086 p.115x","source":"MMK1","locator":"086 p.115x","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/311159363"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BPRY.117x","source":"BPRY","locator":"117x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/464364848"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BSC.457 #840x","source":"BSC","locator":"457 #840x","url":"http://bahai-library.com/compilations/bahai.scriptures/"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BSTW#150","source":"BSTW","locator":"150","url":"http://www.h-net.org/~bahai/docs/vol13/Barstow_101-150.pdf#page=96"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BWF.372-372x","source":"BWF","locator":"372-372x","url":"https://archive.org/details/bahaiworldfaithselectedwritingsofbahaullahandabdulbaha./mode/2up"},{"kind":"translation","code":"SWAB#086x","source":"SWAB","locator":"086x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/244186270"},{"kind":"translation","code":"TAB.325-326","source":"TAB","locator":"325-326","url":"https://books.google.com/books?id=0H8yAQAAMAAJ\u0026pg=PA325"}]},{"code":"AB03461MAR","anchor":"mar","translations":[{"language":"ml","lang_name":"Malayalam"},{"language":"ru","lang_name":"Russian"},{"language":"bi","lang_name":"Bislama"}